# 专注学习站 · 生产 nginx（由 deploy/env/prod.env 渲染）
# 占位符全部来自 deploy/env/prod.env，模板里不写死域名。

server {
    listen 80;
    listen [::]:80;
    server_name __FOCUS_HOST__;

    root __SITE_ROOT__;
    index index.html;

    # HTTP → HTTPS
    location /.well-known/acme-challenge/ { root /var/www/html; }
    location / { return 301 https://__FOCUS_HOST__$request_uri; }
}

server {
    listen 443 ssl;
    listen [::]:443 ssl;
    http2 on;
    server_name __FOCUS_HOST__;

    ssl_certificate __SSL_CERT__;
    ssl_certificate_key __SSL_KEY__;

    root __SITE_ROOT__;
    index index.html;

    gzip on;
    gzip_min_length 1k;
    gzip_vary on;
    gzip_types text/css application/javascript application/json image/svg+xml;

    # 安全响应头：静态站 + 同源身份接口，可以收得很紧
    add_header X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff" always;
    add_header X-Frame-Options "DENY" always;
    add_header Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin" always;
    add_header Permissions-Policy "geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()" always;
    add_header Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'" always;

    # 身份服务：只放行必要的三个端点（路径由环境变量注入），
    # 其余 __IDENTITY_PREFIX__/* 一律 404。
    location = __IDENTITY_API_LOGIN__ {
        proxy_pass __BACKEND_ORIGIN____IDENTITY_API_LOGIN__;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
    }
    location = __IDENTITY_API_SESSION__ {
        proxy_pass __BACKEND_ORIGIN____IDENTITY_API_SESSION__;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
    }
    location = __IDENTITY_API_LOGOUT__ {
        proxy_pass __BACKEND_ORIGIN____IDENTITY_API_LOGOUT__;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
    }

    location __IDENTITY_PREFIX__/ {
        return 404;
    }

    # 带指纹的静态资源：长期缓存
    location ~* ^/_nuxt/.*\.(?:js|mjs|css|woff2?|ttf|otf|png|svg|webp|jpg|jpeg)$ {
        expires 1y;
        add_header Cache-Control "public, max-age=31536000, immutable" always;
        try_files $uri =404;
    }

    # PWA 的 service worker 不缓存
    location = /serviceworker.js {
        add_header Cache-Control "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate" always;
        try_files $uri =404;
    }

    # 外壳不缓存，保证更新即时生效
    location = /index.html {
        add_header Cache-Control "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate" always;
    }

    location / {
        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;
    }
}
